  "tips": "**Posisi benda**\n\n- **next to** = di sebelah, di samping\n- **near** = dekat\n- **behind** = di belakang\n- **in front of** = di depan\n\nPerhatikan kata kecilnya:\n- *in front of* wajib memakai **of**: *in front the house* ✗ → *in front **of** the house* ✓\n- *next to* wajib memakai **to**: *next the door* ✗ → *next **to** the door* ✓\n- *near* **tanpa** *with*: *near with the school* ✗ → *near the school* ✓ (bahasa Indonesia: \"dekat **dengan** sekolah\")\n\nKalimatnya tetap butuh *is / are*: *My house **is** near the school.*\n\nKata baru: **door** = pintu.",
